      "message": "Please review the change\n\nProblem:\nIn the GrowingArrayUtils.java class, the insert methods do not handle cases where currentSize is set to -1. This can lead to exceptions, such as ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException, during operations like array insertion or copying. The lack of validation for currentSize \u003d\u003d -1 across the class can cause system instability or crashes during array operations.\n\nSolution\nTo prevent such crashes, it is necessary to ensure that currentSize never reaches an invalid state like -1. Proper validations should be added wherever currentSize is modified or incremented.\n\nBug Id - https://partnerissuetracker.corp.google.com/u/3/issues/367976403",
